text_01E6:
    string "Across the vast plains ≦≦"    ; ja: はるかぁ～そうげんを≦≦

text_01FF:
    string "So plain, ryu... ≦"           ; ja: 地味りゅ・・・≦

text_0210:
    string "Fundamental human rights for%K%NMY too..."  ; ja: %NMYにも根本的に人権を・・・

text_022D:
    string "Special class, ryu ♪"         ; ja: スペシャルクラスだりゅ♪

text_0246:
    string "Size is proof of power, ryu ♪"  ; ja: 大きさは権力のあかしりゅ♪

text_0261:
    string "With this I've won, ryu ★"    ; ja: これなら勝ったりゅ★

text_0276:
    string "Now it's a little more decent,%Kryu ♭"  ; ja: これで少しまともになったりゅ♭

text_0295:
    string "Middle class, ryu ★"          ; ja: ミドルクラスかりゅ★

text_02AA:
    string "I'll earn more, ryu ♪"        ; ja: もっと稼いでやりゅ♪

text_02BF:
    string "Serves you right, ryu ★"      ; ja: ざまーみやがれりゅ★

text_02D4:
    string "At times like this I repair my%Kbody, ryu"  ; ja: こんな時は体の補修をするりゅ

text_02F1:
    string "...Nice weather, ryu"      ; ja: ・・・いい日和だりゅ～∥｜

text_030C:
    string "Cheap makes me happy, ryu ♪"  ; ja: 安いのはうれしいりゅ♪

text_0323:
    string "Buy it all up, ryu"           ; ja: 買い占めちゃえだりゅ

text_0338:
    string "Will you sell to %NMY too,%Kryu?"  ; ja: %NMYでも売ってくれりゅ？

text_0351:
    string "%NMY's store%Kis not a curiosity shop, ryu!"  ; ja: %NMYのお店は%K珍品屋さんじゃないりゅ！

text_0378:
    string "I want you to feel the romance of%Kthe unknown, ryu"  ; ja: 未知の浪漫を感じて欲しいりゅ

text_0395:
    string "That's the end for now, ryu ♪"  ; ja: とりあえずここでオシマイりゅ♪

text_03B4:
    string "All things pass, ryu..."      ; ja: 諸行無常だりゅ・・・

text_03C9:
    string "Just a little more patience,%Kryu ≦≦≦"  ; ja: もう少しの辛抱りゅ≦≦≦

text_03E2:
    string "Was it okay to ride it, ryu?!"  ; ja: のってもよかったりゅ？！

text_03FB:
    string "I got my pay, ryuuu"           ; ja: 給料をもらえたりゅ～

text_0410:
    string "I'll buy a mysterious object with%Kthis money, ryu ♪"  ; ja: このお金で謎の物体を買うりゅ♪

text_042F:
    string "Pay ★ I got paid, ryu ★"        ; ja: お給料★お給料だりゅ★

text_0446:
    string "There was nothing this convenient%Kin the old days, ryu"  ; ja: こんな便利なの昔はなかったりゅ

text_0465:
    string "Where shall I go next, ryu?"  ; ja: 次はどこに行こうかりゅ？

text_047E:
    string "Elevators are fun, ryu ♪"     ; ja: エレベーターって楽しいりゅ♪

text_049B:
    string "I'll cast an ancient curse, ryu ∵"  ; ja: 太古の呪いをかけてやりゅ∵

text_04B6:
    string "This will ruin me, ryu"       ; ja: これじゃダメになっちゃうりゅ

text_04D3:
    string "I'll surely get even, ryu ≦"  ; ja: きっと仕返ししてやりゅ≦

text_04EC:
    string "I'll decide myself whether it's a%Kloss or a gain, ryu"  ; ja: 損か得かは自分で決めりゅ

text_0505:
    string "A mystery, ryu ★"             ; ja: 謎だりゅ★

text_0510:
    string "I'd be happy if you paid me back%Kthis time too, ryu?"  ; ja: 今度も返してくれるとウレシイりゅ？

text_0533:
    string "No questions asked, ryu..."   ; ja: 問答無用りゅ・・・

text_0546:
    string "I can't relax, ryu"           ; ja: 安心できないりゅ

text_0557:
    string "I hate everyone, ryu..."      ; ja: みんなキライりゅ・・・

text_056E:
    string "Are you still trying, ryu?"   ; ja: まだガンバルのかりゅ？

text_0585:
    string "It was a bargain, ryu ★"      ; ja: お買い得だったりゅ★

text_059A:
    string "%NMY, the great deity!!!"            ; ja: %NMY大明神様！！！

text_05AD:
    string "The expenses aren't going down at%Kall, ryu ≦"  ; ja: 出費が全然減らないりゅ≦

text_05C6:
    string "%NMY has become useless,%Kryu ≦"  ; ja: ダメ%NMYになってりゅ≦

text_05DD:
    string "I can't save money like this,%Kryu ≦"  ; ja: これじゃお金たまんないりゅ≦

text_05FA:
    string "Half done, ryu ♪"             ; ja: 半分終わったりゅ♪

text_060D:
    string "%NMY will keep at it,%Kryu ★"  ; ja: %NMYはこれからもヤルりゅ★

text_0628:
    string "I'll keep trying without letting%Kmy guard down, ryu ♭"  ; ja: 気抜かずにガンバルぞぉりゅ♭

text_0645:
    string "I'll start over with this as%Kcapital, ryu ≦"  ; ja: これを元手にやり直すりゅ≦

text_0660:
    string "You'd better be careful on the%Kroad at night, ryu"  ; ja: 夜道には、気をつけたほうがいいりゅ

text_0683:
    string "I wasn't strong enough...%Khow frustrating, ryu ≦≦"  ; ja: 力及ばず・・・%K悔しいりゅ≦≦

text_06A2:
    string "What a waste, ryu..."         ; ja: もったいないりゅ・・・

text_06B9:
    string "As I thought, not enough money,%Kryu ≦"  ; ja: ヤッパリお金が足りないりゅ≦

text_06D6:
    string "I want a store, ryu"          ; ja: お店が欲しいりゅ

text_06E7:
    string "I'll save a little more money,%Kryu ♪"  ; ja: もちょっとお金を貯めりゅ♪

text_0702:
    string "Should I have bought the store,%Kryu ≦"  ; ja: お店買ってもよかったりゅ≦

text_071D:
    string "No use crying over it, ryu ≦"  ; ja: 後悔しても始まらないりゅ≦

text_0738:
    string "Nowahha"                      ; ja: のわっは

text_0741:
    string "Tomorrow's weather: sunny"    ; ja: 明日の天気は晴れ

